{
    "title": "NFL 2K Playmakers Card Battler",
    "description": "COLLECT FOOTBALL CARDS\r\nNFL 2K Playmakers features hundreds of player cards to collect. Amass NFL players to construct the strongest rosters for offense, defense, and special American football teams. Level up your collection through game play and add equipment that will take your football cards to the MVP level. Fill out your Playbook by collecting player cards from draft picks that give you the greatest chance for victory on your way to the Super Bowl!\r\n\r\nBATTLE FANS AROUND THE WORLD\r\nPut your roster to the test against other player decks. Jump into a Red Zone Drive to call plays against other NFL fans from around the world. Or start an NFL Season and compete for the chance to reach the Super Bowl. Blow past your competition to cement your legacy.\r\nDominate the gridiron! Build your NFL dream team, collect cards, and battle for glory. Download now and unleash your inner MVP!\r\n\r\nBECOME AN NFL PLAYMAKER\r\nCombine your player cards with your American football passion to compete in a real-world, data-driven game mode where your NFL player cards are used in conjunction with real results to score points. See how your choices as a football manager stack up against other players and claim ultimate bragging rights.\r\n\r\nSCORE A TOUCHDOWN AND BEAT YOUR NFL RIVALS ON THE FIELD\r\nJump into an NFL Season to tackle challenging events and battle other NFL fans on your journey to the Super Bowl!\r\nCollect American football players, enhance your roster, and collect digital trading cards of NFL football players as you progress.\r\n\r\nPOWERED BY REAL NFL STATS\r\nPlay calls and attributes are powered by NGS Data. Real football NFL stats from real NFL plays. NFL 2K Playmakers is a card game that is as fanatical as you are about American football. \r\n\r\nFOOTBALL CARD BATTLER\r\nBuild your squad of champs, design your strategy as a coach by collecting player cards, become a draft wizard, battle against rivals, and reach the summit of the leaderboards to secure valuable in-game rewards. Battle for glory and become an NFL MVP!\r\n\r\nPOWERED BY REAL-LIFE NFL DATA\r\nCall the shots and attributes are powered by NGS Data. Assemble your roster of NFL cards, make predictions on game outcomes, and earn exciting in-game rewards based on real-life action during live NFL games.\r\n\r\nCONTINUOUS UPDATES THROUGHOUT THE ENTIRE NFL SEASON\r\nAt NFL 2K Playmakers, the action never stops! We're dedicated to delivering an ever-evolving experience with continuous updates that keep you at the forefront of the NFL season.\r\n\r\nFresh Player Cards: New player cards are constantly being added, featuring your favorite NFL stars and rising talents. Participate in exciting teambuilder drafts picks to build your ultimate roster, selecting the latest and greatest athletes in the NFL league.\r\nExciting Events: Stay engaged with a variety of limited-time events that spotlight the NFL\u2019s stars. Compete in challenges and unlock exclusive rewards to showcase your skills.\r\n\r\nNew Game Modes: Whether you\u2019re aiming for gridiron glory in a Super Bowl victory or strategizing in intense playoff scenarios, we\u2019ve got a mode for every kind of football fan and playbook. Experience the full spectrum of NFL excitement with new challenges tailored to each mode, ensuring non-stop entertainment.\r\n\r\nCommunity Love: A huge shoutout to our passionate NFL 2K Playmakers community of touchdowners and the NFL Network! Your support fuels our drive to keep enhancing the game, making it the best football card battler out there.\r\nDon't miss out on any of the action! Download NFL 2K Playmakers today\u2014the ultimate free-to-play card battler mobile game that brings the thrill of the NFL right to your fingertips!\r\n\r\nSPECS\r\nRequires a device with 4+ GB of RAM and Android 8+ (Android 9.0 recommended). An Internet connection is required. (Android)\r\n\r\nDo Not Sell My Personal Information: https://www.take2games.com/ccpa",
    "descriptionHTML": "COLLECT FOOTBALL CARDS<br>NFL 2K Playmakers features hundreds of player cards to collect. Amass NFL players to construct the strongest rosters for offense, defense, and special American football teams. Level up your collection through game play and add equipment that will take your football cards to the MVP level. Fill out your Playbook by collecting player cards from draft picks that give you the greatest chance for victory on your way to the Super Bowl!<br><br>BATTLE FANS AROUND THE WORLD<br>Put your roster to the test against other player decks. Jump into a Red Zone Drive to call plays against other NFL fans from around the world. Or start an NFL Season and compete for the chance to reach the Super Bowl. Blow past your competition to cement your legacy.<br>Dominate the gridiron! Build your NFL dream team, collect cards, and battle for glory. Download now and unleash your inner MVP!<br><br>BECOME AN NFL PLAYMAKER<br>Combine your player cards with your American football passion to compete in a real-world, data-driven game mode where your NFL player cards are used in conjunction with real results to score points. See how your choices as a football manager stack up against other players and claim ultimate bragging rights.<br><br>SCORE A TOUCHDOWN AND BEAT YOUR NFL RIVALS ON THE FIELD<br>Jump into an NFL Season to tackle challenging events and battle other NFL fans on your journey to the Super Bowl!<br>Collect American football players, enhance your roster, and collect digital trading cards of NFL football players as you progress.<br><br>POWERED BY REAL NFL STATS<br>Play calls and attributes are powered by NGS Data. Real football NFL stats from real NFL plays. NFL 2K Playmakers is a card game that is as fanatical as you are about American football. <br><br>FOOTBALL CARD BATTLER<br>Build your squad of champs, design your strategy as a coach by collecting player cards, become a draft wizard, battle against rivals, and reach the summit of the leaderboards to secure valuable in-game rewards. Battle for glory and become an NFL MVP!<br><br>POWERED BY REAL-LIFE NFL DATA<br>Call the shots and attributes are powered by NGS Data. Assemble your roster of NFL cards, make predictions on game outcomes, and earn exciting in-game rewards based on real-life action during live NFL games.<br><br>CONTINUOUS UPDATES THROUGHOUT THE ENTIRE NFL SEASON<br>At NFL 2K Playmakers, the action never stops! We&#39;re dedicated to delivering an ever-evolving experience with continuous updates that keep you at the forefront of the NFL season.<br><br>Fresh Player Cards: New player cards are constantly being added, featuring your favorite NFL stars and rising talents. Participate in exciting teambuilder drafts picks to build your ultimate roster, selecting the latest and greatest athletes in the NFL league.<br>Exciting Events: Stay engaged with a variety of limited-time events that spotlight the NFL\u2019s stars. Compete in challenges and unlock exclusive rewards to showcase your skills.<br><br>New Game Modes: Whether you\u2019re aiming for gridiron glory in a Super Bowl victory or strategizing in intense playoff scenarios, we\u2019ve got a mode for every kind of football fan and playbook. Experience the full spectrum of NFL excitement with new challenges tailored to each mode, ensuring non-stop entertainment.<br><br>Community Love: A huge shoutout to our passionate NFL 2K Playmakers community of touchdowners and the NFL Network! Your support fuels our drive to keep enhancing the game, making it the best football card battler out there.<br>Don&#39;t miss out on any of the action! Download NFL 2K Playmakers today\u2014the ultimate free-to-play card battler mobile game that brings the thrill of the NFL right to your fingertips!<br><br>SPECS<br>Requires a device with 4+ GB of RAM and Android 8+ (Android 9.0 recommended). An Internet connection is required. (Android)<br><br>Do Not Sell My Personal Information: https://www.take2games.com/ccpa",
